WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
The Jiaojiao Lu family is at best a nouveau riche.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:05,640
Then the old couple couldn't sit still

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:07,640
One works as a security guard in the village

4
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,240
A guarantor

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,080
If you have money, buy gold

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:16,460
This is what country people are like

7
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:19,380
Our Pei family is the real century-old family

8
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,260
Deep luck

9
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:24,890
What does the Lu family compare with us?

10
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:30,770
Isn't the madness of the Pei family contagious?

11
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,530
Worthy of being the richest man, the Lu family

12
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:42,010
Looks like it's quite lively today, Xiao Su Lai

13
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:44,570
Let me introduce to you this is

14
00:00:44,570 --> 00:01:03,870
I know

15
00:01:03,870 --> 00:01:05,980
you are here

16
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:21,780
You dog, how dare you act so boldly?

17
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:26,500
I'll have his legs broken

18
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:35,210
Then I'll bite off your old lamp's legs first.

19
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:36,610
My grandpa's birthday party

20
00:01:36,610 --> 00:01:37,810
you are not welcome
